    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 야생 푸호꼬...\n어쩐지 기운이 없어 보여...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C57CC0DD0020D478D638AF2C002E002E002E000AC5B4CA50C9C00020AE30C6B4C7740020C5C6C5B40020BCF4C5EC002E002E002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코옹...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54C639002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먹이를 줘도 먹질 않고\n포켓몬센터에 데려가도 원인을 모르겠대...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA39C774B97C0020C918B3C40020BA39C9C80020C54AACE0000AD3ECCF13BAACC13CD130C5D00020B370B824AC00B3C40020C6D0C778C7440020BAA8B974ACA0B300002E002E002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지! 한방 약국!\n과거 미르에 있었던 한방 약국의 점주라면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n푸호꼬에게 듣는 약을 알 수 있지 않을까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C000210020D55CBC290020C57DAD6D0021000AACFCAC700020BBF8B974C5D00020C788C5C8B3580020D55CBC290020C57DAD6DC7580020C810C8FCB77CBA7400100001BE00000AD478D638AF2CC5D0AC8C0020B4E3B2940020C57DC7440020C54C0020C2180020C788C9C00020C54AC744AE4C003F00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 푸호꼬를 봐 주고 있을 테니까\n점주에게 가서 물어봐 주지 않을래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020D478D638AF2CB97C0020BD100020C8FCACE00020C788C7440020D14CB2C8AE4C000AC810C8FCC5D0AC8C0020AC00C11C0020BB3CC5B4BD100020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "한방 약국 점주는\n아라모드 카페에 자주 다녔었어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D55CBC290020C57DAD6D0020C810C8FCB294000AC544B77CBAA8B4DC0020CE74D398C5D00020C790C8FC0020B2E4B154C5C8C5B4002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
