      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무슨 일이지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C2A80020C77CC774C9C0003F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전에 약국을 하셨었나요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C804C5D00020C57DAD6DC7440020D558C168C5C8B098C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아픈 포켓몬이 있어요...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544D5080020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C788C5B4C694002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇군...\n푸호꼬가 아프단 말인가?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AD70002E002E002E000AD478D638AF2CAC000020C544D504B2E80020B9D0C778AC00003F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "푸호꼬는 잔가지를 먹으면\n힘이 나고 차분해지는 포켓몬...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D478D638AF2CB2940020C794AC00C9C0B97C0020BA39C73CBA74000AD798C7740020B098ACE00020CC28BD84D574C9C0B2940020D3ECCF13BAAC002E002E002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특히 기력의잔가지를 먹으면\n금세 회복될 것이네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9D7880020AE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0B97C0020BA39C73CBA74000AAE08C1380020D68CBCF5B4200020AC83C774B124002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다만, 기력의잔가지는 현재\n5번 와일드 존에서만 구할 수 있지...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B9CC002C0020AE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0B2940020D604C7AC000A0035BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D0C11CB9CC0020AD6CD5600020C2180020C788C9C0002E002E002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬의 공격을 받으며\n기력의잔가지를 찾는 건 쉬운 일이 아니지만,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n달콤한 향기가 나는 잔가지를 찾아 보게나.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7580020ACF5ACA9C7440020BC1BC73CBA70000AAE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0B97C0020CC3EB2940020AC740020C26CC6B40020C77CC7740020C544B2C8C9C0B9CC002C00100001BE00000AB2ECCF64D55C0020D5A5AE30AC000020B098B2940020C794AC00C9C0B97C0020CC3EC5440020BCF4AC8CB098002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기력의잔가지라면 블르 지구의\n5번 와일드 존에서 구할 수 있을 것이네.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n달콤한 향기가 나는 잔가지를 찾아 보게나.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0B77CBA740020BE14B9740020C9C0AD6CC758000A0035BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D0C11C0020AD6CD5600020C2180020C788C7440020AC83C774B124002E00100001BE00000AB2ECCF64D55C0020D5A5AE30AC000020B098B2940020C794AC00C9C0B97C0020CC3EC5440020BCF4AC8CB098002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금 시들어 있다...\n기력의잔가지는 아닌 것 같다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870AE080020C2DCB4E4C5B40020C788B2E4002E002E002E000AAE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0B2940020C544B2CC0020AC830020AC19B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갉아 먹은 흔적이 있다...\n기력의잔가지는 아닌 것 같다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC09C5440020BA39C7400020D754C801C7740020C788B2E4002E002E002E000AAE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0B2940020C544B2CC0020AC830020AC19B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "살짝 부러져 있다...\n기력의잔가지는 아닌 것 같다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0B4C9DD0020BD80B7ECC8380020C788B2E4002E002E002E000AAE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0B2940020C544B2CC0020AC830020AC19B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바싹 말라서 뻣뻣하다...\n기력의잔가지는 아닌 것 같다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14C2F90020B9D0B77CC11C0020BEE3BEE3D558B2E4002E002E002E000AAE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0B2940020C544B2CC0020AC830020AC19B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "달콤한 향기가 난다...\n기력의잔가지를 찾았다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2ECCF64D55C0020D5A5AE30AC000020B09CB2E4002E002E002E000AAE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0B97C0020CC3EC558B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기운이 없는\n푸호꼬가 있는 곳으로 돌아가자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C6B4C7740020C5C6B294000AD478D638AF2CAC000020C788B2940020ACF3C73CB85C0020B3CCC544AC00C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기력의잔가지...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n한방 약국 점주분도 대단하고\n그걸 찾아낸 너도 대단해!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B825C758C794AC00C9C0002E002E002E00100001BE01000AD55CBC290020C57DAD6D0020C810C8FCBD84B3C40020B300B2E8D558ACE0000AADF8AC780020CC3EC544B0B80020B108B3C40020B300B2E8D574002100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 푸호꼬에게 먹여 주렴.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020D478D638AF2CC5D0AC8C0020BA39C5EC0020C8FCB834002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n푸호꼬에게 기력의잔가지를 주었다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
