      "displayText": "코옹!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54C63900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "푸호꼬가\n기운을 차려서 다행이야...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D478D638AF2CAC00000AAE30C6B4C7440020CC28B824C11C0020B2E4D589C774C57C002E002E002E002100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코옹!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54C63900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머나, 푸호꼬도 참.\n네가 마음에 들었나 봐.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이참에 동료로 만드는 건 어떠니?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA38B098002C0020D478D638AF2CB3C40020CC38002E000AB124AC000020B9C8C74CC5D00020B4E4C5C8B0980020BD10002E00100001BE00000AC774CC38C5D00020B3D9B8CCB85C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020AC740020C5B4B5A0B2C8003F00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코옹!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54C63900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "푸호꼬를 잡았다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D478D638AF2CB97C0020C7A1C558B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "푸호꼬를 소중히 대해 주렴!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D478D638AF2CB97C0020C18CC911D7880020B300D5740020C8FCB834002100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "푸호꼬를 동료로 만들려면\n박스를 정리해 주십시오.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D478D638AF2CB97C0020B3D9B8CCB85C0020B9CCB4E4B824BA74000ABC15C2A4B97C0020C815B9ACD5740020C8FCC2EDC2DCC624002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
